# Audio / video originals — global catch-all (defense in depth).
# Originals belong in S3 or LFS, never git. The pre-publish gate
# (AgentConfig/scripts/pre-publish.py check 72) will BLOCK any tracked
# file >25 MB, but this keeps them out of the index in the first place.
*.wav
*.flac
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.opus
*.mov
*.mp4
*.aac

# Generic personal-research data directories — never meant for git
local-archive/
recordings/
